      "paragraphs": 4,
      "summary": "吾生也有涯，而知也无涯。以有涯随无涯，殆已。"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "title": "人间世",
      "part": "内篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/ren-shi-jian.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E4%BA%BA%E9%96%93%E4%B8%96&oldid=11117687",
      "wiki_revision": 11117687,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E4%BA%BA%E9%96%93%E4%B8%96",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_004.txt",
