      "wiki_text_sha256": "4cbc7cc4bf8a531a55bad0b834848a2b6eea40ce6c90bd72fd3323787480ba8c",
      "paragraphs": 7,
      "summary": "德荡乎名，知出乎争。名也者，相轧也；知也者，争之器也。二者凶器，非所以尽行也。"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "title": "德充符",
      "part": "内篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/de-chong-fu.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E5%BE%B7%E5%85%85%E7%AC%A6&oldid=11117688",
