      "wiki_text_sha256": "9eb20193d81d54c6d4d68b15be06ddf8d1f4b5f15e0c4fb291aaf2b6b548597a",
      "paragraphs": 6,
      "summary": "人莫鉴于流水而鉴于止水，唯止能止众止。"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "title": "大宗师",
      "part": "内篇",
