      "wiki_text_sha256": "886977db85e8a0a4ab3020abbc0e8505eead97c61dea60ad81217ccebeb16abf",
      "paragraphs": 6,
      "summary": "人皆有七窍以视听食息，此独无有，尝试凿之。日凿一窍，七日而浑沌死。"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "title": "骈拇",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/pian-mu.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E9%A7%A2%E6%8B%87&oldid=11117691",
