      "paragraphs": 4,
      "summary": "凫胫虽短， 续之则忧； 鹤胫虽长， 断之则悲"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "title": "马蹄",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/ma-ti.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E9%A6%AC%E8%B9%84&oldid=11117692",
