      "paragraphs": 3,
      "summary": "夫至德之世，同与禽兽居，族与万物并，恶乎知君子小人哉"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "title": "胠箧",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/qu-qie.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E8%83%A0%E7%AF%8B&oldid=11117696",
      "wiki_revision": 11117696,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E8%83%A0%E7%AF%8B",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_010.txt",
