      "wiki_text_sha256": "8ee6a3fd94a3f77be690d2657a91eba2067685a25e23f75a39351de583d8c6bd",
      "paragraphs": 7,
      "summary": "圣人不死， 大盗不止"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "title": "在宥",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/zai-you.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%A5&oldid=11117697",
      "wiki_revision": 11117697,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E5%9C%A8%E5%AE%A5",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_011.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "4673c3ad1b92ef9fe2142af713f65c1486512a929c319c7f63d6f5a8ff5e1226",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "e033df6a9a4ceb8caf92d3296f889c7d1563da2bee74a133bc361c570a11559a",
      "paragraphs": 8,
      "summary": "出入六合，游乎九州，独往独来，是谓独有。独有之人，是之谓至贵。"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "title": "天地",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/tian-di.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0&oldid=11117698",
      "wiki_revision": 11117698,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E5%A4%A9%E5%9C%B0",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_012.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "84ba5f82af4e08a3823db40414e619cb3bbd4689271c1e0381c4a80b4dfe8e73",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "1932e22fe8a13807bddb9e50caa1b02d1280026679ffa1ab7dabcd37291b685e",
      "paragraphs": 16,
      "summary": "有机械者必有机事，有机事者必有机心。机心存于胷中则纯白不备，纯白不备则神生不定，神生不定者，道之所不载也。吾非不知，羞而不为也。"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "title": "天道",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/tian-dao.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E5%A4%A9%E9%81%93&oldid=11117699",
      "wiki_revision": 11117699,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E5%A4%A9%E9%81%93",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_013.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "8f3a496db5e95db543a716cebaea7924ff3dc8873dff2027d9f6b624dbcf089c",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "552b1542c151c9a4e27eb55debe1b79ed58a5a465e1c0c70fdbaf50c97e7d21e",
      "paragraphs": 10,
      "summary": "古之人与！其不可传也，死矣！然则君之所读者，古人之糟魄已矣！"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "title": "天运",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/tian-yun.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E5%A4%A9%E9%81%8B&oldid=11117700",
      "wiki_revision": 11117700,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E5%A4%A9%E9%81%8B",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_014.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "c6895288be8693123cd312f7c6e5d9c5c7efc7571aee835af3ee9d9c40ec017d",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "f770eae54d1c890935e0822f820c7dedba9b746dce79cf4e317925f24725f525",
      "paragraphs": 8,
      "summary": "泉涸， 鱼相与处于陆， 相呴以湿， 相濡以沫， 不若相忘于江湖！"
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "title": "刻意",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/ke-yi.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E5%88%BB%E6%84%8F&oldid=11117701",
      "wiki_revision": 11117701,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E5%88%BB%E6%84%8F",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_015.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "99f2fd40427e96f226a944b2b27f6b0f0614d49a424171b13f32c314b7a99bcf",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "bcc32bda4b2ae0add7310cf2e6b9d934180bfd7c7d915527814903072a57cc1c",
      "paragraphs": 4,
      "summary": "不为福先，不为祸始；感而后应，迫而后动，不得已而后起。"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "title": "缮性",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/shan-xing.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E7%B9%95%E6%80%A7&oldid=11117702",
      "wiki_revision": 11117702,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E7%B9%95%E6%80%A7",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_016.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "74833786a8e67e283169f7975d5f553865ac8437af9bdc9698705700862f15b6",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "7846f2d54e9872f268c6a7281c38ff3d28751d703900373c4b855b616cdc7d15",
      "paragraphs": 4,
      "summary": "道无以兴乎世， 世无以兴乎道， 虽圣人不在山林之中， 其德隐矣"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "title": "秋水",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/qiu-shui.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E7%A7%8B%E6%B0%B4&oldid=11117703",
      "wiki_revision": 11117703,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E7%A7%8B%E6%B0%B4",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_017.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "6926f8662b7270c81a9436331d483d2b5f7faa31e0179ab61e4722989ac6605b",
