      "paragraphs": 12,
      "summary": "井蛙不可以语于海者，拘于墟也。夏虫不可以语于冰者，笃于时也。曲士不可以语于道者，束于教也。"
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "title": "至乐",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/zhi-le.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E8%87%B3%E6%A8%82&oldid=11117704",
      "wiki_revision": 11117704,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E8%87%B3%E6%A8%82",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_018.txt",
