      "wiki_text_sha256": "9b429aa6bee2e00f710623a73252bf581418937072a12490ea5e13f036025b76",
      "paragraphs": 6,
      "summary": "庄子妻死，惠子吊之，庄子则方箕踞鼔盆而歌。"
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "title": "达生",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/da-sheng.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E9%81%94%E7%94%9F&oldid=11117705",
      "wiki_revision": 11117705,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E9%81%94%E7%94%9F",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_019.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "8727162d96fd29611eda1521c1302d33e9d8caa3edd536aea583dcfbbf50a858",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "11346354677889eab1a2577058bc41b52e37486e524e53260f79a8a15599bd99",
      "paragraphs": 12,
      "summary": "人之所取畏者，衽席之上，饮食之间，而不知为之戒者，过也！"
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "title": "山木",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/shan-mu.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E5%B1%B1%E6%9C%A8&oldid=11117707",
      "wiki_revision": 11117707,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E5%B1%B1%E6%9C%A8",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_020.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "e7aa16f5221fd777ed4acf1e6b301b1e06161a33a3ac0ea0036c9f15b075aee4",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "9c88311505e644da4a1a1c7b9434c65208dbc9238f6b89491129721c9da6cf68",
      "paragraphs": 9,
      "summary": "贫也，非惫也。士有道德不能行，惫也；衣弊履穿，贫也，非惫也，此所谓非遭时也。"
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "title": "田子方",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/tian-zi-fang.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E7%94%B0%E5%AD%90%E6%96%B9&oldid=11117709",
      "wiki_revision": 11117709,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E7%94%B0%E5%AD%90%E6%96%B9",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_021.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "47a6c9f8edb60282c2f51d70131888aa4c1106249a79afbe45380903e40ecfb0",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "67d275a5dc1739c00a2a72242c99bd10ecc4ac474c9ac789878c62900793f4c9",
      "paragraphs": 11,
      "summary": "吾以其来不可却也，其去不可止也，吾以为得失之非我也，而无忧色而已矣。"
    },
    {
      "number": 22,
      "title": "知北游",
      "part": "外篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/zhi-bei-you.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E7%9F%A5%E5%8C%97%E9%81%8A&oldid=11117710",
      "wiki_revision": 11117710,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E7%9F%A5%E5%8C%97%E9%81%8A",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_022.txt",
      "kanripo_sha256": "e550fd8758b77e666f76ed75720789bdf42e9713c05f95d38b4fd01d3cec0a10",
      "wiki_text_sha256": "6ce9c81dde46ecb05af6f836496256c50f68b8acaaaeeeb644390123be549c17",
      "paragraphs": 12,
      "summary": "天地有大美而不言"
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "title": "庚桑楚",
      "part": "杂篇",
      "path": "content/posts/taoism/zhuangzi/geng-sang-chu.md",
      "wiki_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90%2F%E5%BA%9A%E6%A1%91%E6%A5%9A&oldid=11117711",
      "wiki_revision": 11117711,
      "wiki_original_url": "https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%8E%8A%E5%AD%90/%E5%BA%9A%E6%A1%91%E6%A5%9A",
      "kanripo_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kanripo/KR5c0126/abb9cd323dfd9520894b56b3b8ba2ec0ea50554f/KR5c0126_023.txt",
